Package: MultiMapR
Title: Mapping and Visualization of Discrete Characters on Phylogenies
Version: 1.0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kevin Isaac", "Alcántara Estrada", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "isaac.ae@ciencias.unam.mx"),
    person("Jatziri", "Linares Rios", role = "aut",
           email = "jatzirilin@ciencias.unam.mx"),
    person("Jesús Alberto", "Díaz Cruz", role = "aut",
           email = "vertebrata.j@geologia.unam.mx"))
Description: Maps and visualizes discrete morphological, ecological, or molecular
    characters on phylogenetic trees. Supports simple terminal mapping and ancestral
    state reconstruction (depth-weighted majority and Fitch parsimony with ACCTRAN,
    DELTRAN, and Unambiguous modes) across phylogram, cladogram, and fan topologies.
    Exports publication-ready PNG and PDF figures.
